      "title": "File:1st Glorious Mystery Stained Glass Window (Resurrection) Cathedral of the Madeleine Salt Lake City.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/1st_Glorious_Mystery_Stained_Glass_Window_%28Resurrection%29_Cathedral_of_the_Madeleine_Salt_Lake_City.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1st_Glorious_Mystery_Stained_Glass_Window_(Resurrection)_Cathedral_of_the_Madeleine_Salt_Lake_City.jpg",
